==Acquisition==
{{M|Archon Stretch}} is available from [[Chipper]] of {{Faction|Kahl's Garrison}} for 40 {{Resource|Stock (Kahl)}}, requiring players to be at '''Rank 3 - Fort''' to purchase.

==Notes==
*'''[[Abilities]]''' from Warframes or companions that deal {{D|Electricity}} '''damage''' will grant the {{M|Archon Stretch}} buff, regenerating '''2''' Energy per second for '''5''' seconds, for a total of '''10''' energy restored.
**Does not stack or refresh; only 1 buff can be active at any time
**Casting an ability will stop the energy generation for '''1''' second.
***This includes abilities that activate the buff.
***[[Channeled Abilities]] that drain energy over time, such as {{A|Immolation}}, {{A|Sound Quake}}, and {{A|Renewal}} will completely prevent energy generation for as long as they are active.
**Does not scale with mod rank, so the mod can optionally be left unranked to save capacity
**{{D|Electricity}} status effects from abilities can trigger the buff.
***Including the forced {{D|Electricity}} status effect created from {{D|Magnetic}} status effects.

