==Trivia==
*{{M|Archon Stretch}} is currently the only Archon mod whose standard counterpart doesn't have a legendary variant (Primed or Umbra version). And similar to {{M|Archon Intensify}}, it takes its maxed stat from its standard counterpart rather than its legendary variant.

==See also==
*{{M|Stretch}}, the normal version of this mod with much lower capacity cost.

